  },
  "body_html": "<div class=\"follower-sheet\" data-sheet=\"inventory\">\n<p>Wenn du dich <strong><em>Ausrüstest</em></strong>, markiere unten eine Anzahl ◇, bei bestimmten Gegenständen oder unter Unbestimmt.</p>\n<ul class=\"bullets\">\n<li>Für eine <strong>leichte Last</strong> (<em>schnell &amp; leise</em>), markiere bis zu 3 ◇</li>\n<li>Für eine <strong>normale Last</strong>, markiere 4-6 ◇</li>\n<li>Für eine <strong>schwere Last</strong> (<em>laut, langsam, heiß, schnell erschöpft</em>), markiere 7-9 ◇</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"undefined\">Unbestimmt</h3>\n<div class=\"fs-uses\"><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"inv-undef\"><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-0\" title=\"Markierung 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-0\" aria-label=\"Markierung 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-1\" title=\"Markierung 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-1\" aria-label=\"Markierung 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-2\" title=\"Markierung 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-2\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-2\" aria-label=\"Markierung 3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-3\" title=\"Markierung 4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-3\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-3\" aria-label=\"Markierung 4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-4\" title=\"Markierung 5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-4\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-4\" aria-label=\"Markierung 5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-5\" title=\"Markierung 6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-5\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-5\" aria-label=\"Markierung 6\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-6\" title=\"Markierung 7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-6\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-6\" aria-label=\"Markierung 7\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-7\" title=\"Markierung 8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-7\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-7\" aria-label=\"Markierung 8\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-undef-8\" title=\"Markierung 9\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-undef-8\" data-check-id=\"inv-undef-8\" aria-label=\"Markierung 9\"></label></span></div></div>\n<p>Wenn du <strong><em>das Nötige dabeihast</em></strong>, verschiebe eine Markierung von hier zu einem bestimmten ◇ unten.</p>\n<h3 id=\"gear\">Ausrüstung</h3>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-supplies-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-supplies-0\" aria-label=\"Platz\"></span><label for=\"inv-supplies-0\"><span><strong>Vorräte</strong> (4+Wohlstand Anwendungen ○○○○ ○○)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-more-supplies-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-more-supplies-0\" aria-label=\"Platz\"></span><label for=\"inv-more-supplies-0\"><span><strong>Weitere Vorräte</strong> (4+Wohlstand Anwendungen ○○○○ ○○)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-even-more-supplies-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-even-more-supplies-0\" aria-label=\"Platz\"></span><label for=\"inv-even-more-supplies-0\"><span><strong>Noch mehr Vorräte</strong> (4+Wohlstand Anwendungen ○○○○ ○○)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"fs-muted\"><em>Nutze Vorräte, um zu Genesen, dein Lager aufzuschlagen oder zusätzliche <em>kleine</em> Gegenstände dabeizuhaben.</em></p>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-mess-kit-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-mess-kit-0\" aria-label=\"Platz\"></span><label for=\"inv-mess-kit-0\"><span><strong>Kochgeschirr</strong> (erfordert Feuer &amp; Wasser; lässt Vorräte länger reichen)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-bedroll-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-bedroll-0\" aria-label=\"Platz\"></span><label for=\"inv-bedroll-0\"><span><strong>Schlafrolle</strong> (stelle 1d6 zusätzliche HP wieder her, wenn du dein Lager aufschlägst)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-blanket-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-blanket-0\" aria-label=\"Platz\"></span><label for=\"inv-blanket-0\"><span><strong>Decke</strong> (<em>warm</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-change-of-clothes-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-change-of-clothes-0\" aria-label=\"Platz\"></span><label for=\"inv-change-of-clothes-0\"><span><strong>Wechselkleidung</strong></span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-rope-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-rope-0\" aria-label=\"Platz\"></span><label for=\"inv-rope-0\"><span><strong>Seil</strong>, ~8 m</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-shovel-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-shovel-0\" aria-label=\"Platz\"></span><label for=\"inv-shovel-0\"><span><strong>Schaufel</strong></span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-sledge-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-sledge-0\" aria-label=\"Platz\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-sledge-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-sledge-1\" aria-label=\"Platz\"></span><label for=\"inv-sledge-0\"><span><strong>Schlitten/Trage/Schleppgestell</strong>, ausrollbar</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-snow-shoes-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-snow-shoes-0\" aria-label=\"Platz\"></span><label for=\"inv-snow-shoes-0\"><span><strong>Schneeschuhe</strong></span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-torch-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-torch-0\" aria-label=\"Platz\"></span><label for=\"inv-torch-0\"><span><strong>Fackel</strong> (hält ~1 Stunde; <em>Reichweite</em>, <em>Fläche</em>, <em>gefährlich</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-oil-lamp-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-oil-lamp-0\" aria-label=\"Platz\"></span><label for=\"inv-oil-lamp-0\"><span><strong>Öllampe</strong> (○○○ Stunden, <em>nah</em>, <em>Fläche</em>, <em>primitiv</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-extra-oil-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-extra-oil-0\" aria-label=\"Platz\"></span><label for=\"inv-extra-oil-0\"><span><strong>Reserveöl</strong> (○○○○○ Stunden, für Lampe/Laterne, als Waffe nutzlos)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-firewood-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-firewood-0\" aria-label=\"Platz\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-firewood-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-firewood-1\" aria-label=\"Platz\"></span><label for=\"inv-firewood-0\"><span><strong>Brennholz</strong> (reicht für 1 ganze Nacht, <em>Reichweite</em>, <em>Fläche</em>)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-hatchet-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-hatchet-0\" aria-label=\"Platz\"></span><label for=\"inv-hatchet-0\"><span><strong>Handbeil</strong>, Eisen (<em>Hand</em>, <em>geworfen</em>, x durchdringend)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-mallet-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-mallet-0\" aria-label=\"Platz\"></span><label for=\"inv-mallet-0\"><span><strong>Schlegel</strong>, Eisen und/oder Holz (<em>Hand</em>)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-mattock-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-mattock-0\" aria-label=\"Platz\"></span><label for=\"inv-mattock-0\"><span><strong>Breithacke</strong>, Eisen (<em>nah</em>, x durchdringend, <em>grausig</em>, <em>unhandlich</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-maul-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-maul-0\" aria-label=\"Platz\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-maul-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-maul-1\" aria-label=\"Platz\"></span><label for=\"inv-maul-0\"><span><strong>Vorschlaghammer</strong>, Eisen (<em>nah</em>, <em>wuchtig</em>, <em>unhandlich</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-staff-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-staff-0\" aria-label=\"Platz\"></span><label for=\"inv-staff-0\"><span><strong>Stab</strong> (<em>nah</em>)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-spear-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-spear-0\" aria-label=\"Platz\"></span><label for=\"inv-spear-0\"><span><strong>Speer</strong>, Eisen (<em>nah</em>, <em>geworfen</em>, x durchdringend)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-long-spear-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-long-spear-0\" aria-label=\"Platz\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-long-spear-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-long-spear-1\" aria-label=\"Platz\"></span><label for=\"inv-long-spear-0\"><span><strong>Langspeer</strong>, Eisen (<em>Reichweite</em>, x durchdringend)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-bow-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-bow-0\" aria-label=\"Platz\"></span><label for=\"inv-bow-0\"><span><strong>Bogen &amp; Eisenpfeile</strong> (<em>kurz</em>, x durchdringend, ○ Munition knapp, ○ aufgebraucht)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-extra-arrows-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-extra-arrows-0\" aria-label=\"Platz\"></span><label for=\"inv-extra-arrows-0\"><span><strong>Reservepfeile</strong> (x durchdringend, ○ reichlich übrig, ○ Munition knapp, ○ aufgebraucht)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-javelins-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-javelins-0\" aria-label=\"Platz\"></span><label for=\"inv-javelins-0\"><span><strong>Wurfspeere</strong>, einige, Eisen (<em>geworfen</em>, x durchdringend, +1 Schaden, ○ aufgebraucht)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-shield-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-shield-0\" aria-label=\"Platz\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-shield-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-shield-1\" aria-label=\"Platz\"></span><label for=\"inv-shield-0\"><span><strong>Schild</strong> (+1 Rüstung, +1 Bereitschaft bei 7+ beim Verteidigen)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-thick-hides-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-thick-hides-0\" aria-label=\"Platz\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-thick-hides-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-thick-hides-1\" aria-label=\"Platz\"></span><label for=\"inv-thick-hides-0\"><span><strong>Dicke Felle</strong> (1 Rüstung, <em>warm</em>)</span></label></li>\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-cloak-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-cloak-0\" aria-label=\"Platz\"></span><label for=\"inv-cloak-0\"><span><strong>Umhang</strong> (<em>warm</em>)</span></label></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"possessions-items-loot\">Besitztümer, Gegenstände, Beute</h3>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list\">\n<li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot0-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot0-0\" aria-label=\"Platz\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot0\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Gegenstand\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot1-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot1-0\" aria-label=\"Platz\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot1\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Gegenstand\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot2-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot2-0\" aria-label=\"Platz\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot2\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Gegenstand\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot3-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot3-0\" aria-label=\"Platz\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot3\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Gegenstand\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot4-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot4-0\" aria-label=\"Platz\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot4\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Gegenstand\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot5-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot5-0\" aria-label=\"Platz\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot5\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Gegenstand\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot6-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot6-0\" aria-label=\"Platz\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot6\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Gegenstand\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li><li class=\"inv-item\"><span class=\"inv-slots\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-loot7-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-loot7-0\" aria-label=\"Platz\"></span><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:loot7\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"Gegenstand\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"other-things\">Anderes</h3>\n<p class=\"fs-muted\">(Tiere, Gerätschaften, Verstecktes usw.)</p>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-notes\"><textarea class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"inventory:other-things\" rows=\"2\" aria-label=\"Anderes\"></textarea></div>\n<h3 id=\"small-items\">Kleine Gegenstände</h3>\n<p>Passen in Tasche, Beutel oder Stiefel. Wenn du dich <strong><em>Ausrüstest</em></strong>, markiere unten ☐ in Höhe von 4+Wohlstand.</p>\n<div class=\"fs-uses\"><div class=\"arcana-track\" data-check-list=\"inv-small-undef\"><span class=\"track-label\">Unbestimmt</span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-0\" title=\"Markierung 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-0\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-0\" aria-label=\"Markierung 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-1\" title=\"Markierung 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-1\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-1\" aria-label=\"Markierung 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-2\" title=\"Markierung 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-2\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-2\" aria-label=\"Markierung 3\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-3\" title=\"Markierung 4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-3\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-3\" aria-label=\"Markierung 4\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-4\" title=\"Markierung 5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-4\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-4\" aria-label=\"Markierung 5\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"inv-small-undef-5\" title=\"Markierung 6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-small-undef-5\" data-check-id=\"inv-small-undef-5\" aria-label=\"Markierung 6\"></label></span></div></div>\n<p>Wenn du <strong><em>das Nötige dabeihast</em></strong>, verschiebe eine Markierung von hier zu den Gegenständen unten, oder verbrauche Vorräte, um ein zusätzliches ☐ zu markieren.</p>\n<ul class=\"fs-lines check-list inv-list inv-small\">\n<li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-knife\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-knife\" data-check-id=\"inv-knife\"> <span><strong>Messer oder Dolch</strong>, Eisen (<em>Hand</em>)</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-sling\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-sling\" data-check-id=\"inv-sling\"> <span><strong>Schleuder</strong> (<em>kurz</em>, <em>nachladen</em>, <em>unhandlich</em>, ○ Munition knapp, ○ aufgebraucht)</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-rushlight\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-rushlight\" data-check-id=\"inv-rushlight\"> <span><strong>Binsenlicht</strong> (hält ~15-30 Minuten, <em>Hand</em>, <em>primitiv</em>)</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-tinderbox\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-tinderbox\" data-check-id=\"inv-tinderbox\"> <span><strong>Zunderbüchse</strong> (<em>langsam</em>)</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-needle-thread\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-needle-thread\" data-check-id=\"inv-needle-thread\"> <span><strong>Nadel &amp; Faden</strong></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-coppers\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-coppers\" data-check-id=\"inv-coppers\"> <span><strong>Eine Handvoll Kupferstücke</strong></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-whisky\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-whisky\" data-check-id=\"inv-whisky\"> <span><strong>Whisky</strong>, Schlauch (○○ Anwendungen)</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-awl\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-awl\" data-check-id=\"inv-awl\"> <span>Ahle</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-bowstring\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-bowstring\" data-check-id=\"inv-bowstring\"> <span>Bogensehne</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-chalk\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-chalk\" data-check-id=\"inv-chalk\"> <span>Kreide</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-charcoal\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-charcoal\" data-check-id=\"inv-charcoal\"> <span>Holzkohle</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inv-clay-jar\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inv-clay-jar\" data-check-id=\"inv-clay-jar\"> <sp